<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $2.55 million Paris Open tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat 7-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) 3-6 6-1 7-5  </p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 7-6 (9-7) 6-2</p>
<p>Fernon Wibier (Netherlands) beat Francisco Clavet (Spain) 6-7 (3-7) 6-4 6-3  </p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 3-6 7-6 (8-6) 6-4</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat 15-Jim Courier (U.S.) 6-4 7-5  </p>
<p>Add second round:</p>
<p>11-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 6-3 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>16-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 6-1 5-7 6-2</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Mark Philippoussis (Australia) 7-5 3-6 7-6 (9-7)  </p>
<p>Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat 9-Andre Agassi (U.S.) 6-4 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>(ends results)</p>
</text>
